@startuml HRMS_Sequence_Payroll
title HRMS - Payroll Processing Sequence

actor "Payroll Admin" as PA
participant "React Web" as UI
participant "Node.js API" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB
queue "SQS" as SQS
participant "FastAPI Payroll Engine" as PE
participant "Payroll Worker" as PW
participant S3
participant SES

PA -> UI: Start payroll
UI -> API: POST /payroll-runs
API -> DB: BEGIN + SET LOCAL app.tenant_id
API -> DB: Create PayrollRun = DRAFT
API -> DB: Validate eligible employees
API -> DB: Create payroll input snapshots
API -> DB: Insert PayrollRunCreated outbox event
DB --> API: Commit
API --> UI: Payroll run created

PW -> SQS: Consume PayrollRunCreated
SQS --> PW: Event {tenant_id,event_id,payroll_run_id}
PW -> DB: Establish tenant context
PW -> DB: Check processed_event
PW -> DB: Set PayrollRun = CALCULATING
PW -> PE: Submit calculation job

PE -> DB: Load payroll snapshots
PE -> PE: Calculate earnings
PE -> PE: Calculate LOP
PE -> PE: Calculate statutory deductions
PE -> PE: Calculate tax
PE -> PE: Calculate net pay
PE -> DB: Persist calculation results
PE -> DB: Mark event processed
PE -> SQS: Publish PayrollCalculated

API -> DB: Set PayrollRun = UNDER_REVIEW
PA -> UI: Review payroll
PA -> UI: Approve payroll
UI -> API: POST /payroll-runs/{id}/finalize
API -> DB: BEGIN + SET LOCAL app.tenant_id
API -> DB: Validate payroll
API -> DB: Set FINALIZED
API -> DB: Insert PayrollFinalized outbox event
DB --> API: Commit

PW -> SQS: Consume PayrollFinalized
PW -> S3: Generate/store payslip PDFs
PW -> SES: Email payslip notification
PW -> DB: Store document metadata
PW -> DB: Mark notification complete

note over PE,DB
Finalized salary slips are immutable snapshots.
Corrections use adjustments, reversals or supplementary payroll.
end note

@enduml
